			"source": "product_rule(dL32)\ndistribute(dL32)\nsubstitute(dL32, $D_{\\mu}{\\Gamma^{m n p}} -> 0$)\nsubstitute(dL32, $D_{\\mu}{e} -> e e_{q}^{\\lambda} D_{\\mu}{e^{q}_{\\lambda}}$)\nsubstitute(dL32, $D_{\\mu}{e_{m}^{\\nu}} -> - e_{m}^{\\lambda} D_{\\mu}{e^{q}_{\\lambda}} e_{q}^{\\nu}$)\nsubstitute(dL32, $D_{\\mu}{D_{\\nu}{\\psi_{\\rho}}} -> 1/8 R_{\\mu\\nu}^{m n} \\Gamma_{m n} \\psi_{\\rho}$)\ndistribute(dL32);"
